      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <h3>Submit your first post</h3>
        <p>Send it over for review. We turn reviews around in three business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">5</div>
